        <activityName xml:lang="en">Poultry litter pellets, burned in furnace, produced on site</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Poultry litter pellets, burned in furnace, produced on site
Air emission data completed with the inventory of wood chips, from forest, mixed, burned in furnace 300kW;
UUID: 576c890b-8b66-3dce-9b08-c2348557c89c
This data set includes fuel, infrastructure, ash disposal and air emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: grate furnace 300kW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_576c890b-8b66-3dce-9b08-c2348557c89c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
